# D3-AN-008: Conductivity can detect an electrolyte without identifying its anion
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 NaBr 0.001mol
add v3 water 50mL
add v3 sucrose 0.001mol
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 conductivity
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
measure v3 uvvis
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
